  "cards": [
    {
      "dot": "cyan",
      "title": "Request paths",
      "items": [
        "proxy.ts serves EN at / (rewritten to /en) and VI at /vi",
        "Public reads use the anon key; RLS shows only published rows",
        "/go/[slug] counts opens via track_source_open, then redirects to GitHub"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "emerald",
      "title": "Content Engine",
      "items": [
        "Cron fires hourly; the run starts once per Vietnam day at the hour set in /admin",
        "Writes go through RPCs guarded by AIRSC_INGEST_TOKEN",
        "Previewer copies README images to Vercel Blob; picks and the X draft come last",
        "AI work stops when the gateway balance or run cap is hit"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "violet",
      "title": "Daily X post",
      "items": [
        "/api/cron/social posts today's draft from the hour set in /admin/social",
        "The draft row is claimed (draft to posting) so it can never go out twice",
        "Card rendered with next/og, then POST /2/media/upload and /2/tweets"
      ]
    },
    {
      "dot": "amber",
      "title": "Code vs README",
      "items": [
        "README lists Polar checkout routes; no /api/checkout exists at this commit",
        "README says the engine runs at 02:00 UTC; the hour is a setting in /admin",
        "/api/cron/crawl exists but vercel.ts does not schedule it"
      ]
    }
  ]
